ens de grandeza diferentes: o eixo e este texto mostram valores originais; o tracejado marca a mediana dos meses (0,66%).&#10;Classe/série: Subclasse Subordinada Subordinada 1 | (a de mais meses publicados).&#10;Gráfico winsorizado a 2,5% de cada lado: meses abaixo de P2,5 (-10,84%) ou acima de P97,5 (17,61%) aparecem nesses limites (2 meses); a média e o desvio usam os valores publicados (de -12,82% a 25,63%).&#10;Campo CVM TAB_X_VL_RENTAB_MES (tabela inf_mensal_fidc_tab_X_3), publicado em %.\">     <div class=\"tm-rdm-title\">Rentabilidade mensal</div>     <svg class=\"tm-rd-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 62\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Média 1,15% ao mês · desvio-padrão 7,53 p.p. · 19 meses (mai/2024 a nov/2025) · último mês 0,16%\"><line class=\"tm-rd-axis\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"46\" y2=\"46\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"4.6\" y=\"29.5\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"16.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"39.9\" y=\"40.5\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"5.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"75.3\" y=\"24.0\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"22.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"110.6\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"145.9\" y=\"35.0\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"11.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"181.3\" y=\"29.5\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"16.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path class=\"tm-rd-curve\" d=\"M4.0,41.7 L7.6,41.2 L11.2,40.6 L14.8,40.0 L18.4,39.3 L22.0,38.6 L25.6,37.9 L29.2,37.1 L32.7,36.3 L36.3,35.4 L39.9,34.5 L43.5,33.6 L47.1,32.6 L50.7,31.7 L54.3,30.7 L57.9,29.7 L61.5,28.8 L65.1,27.8 L68.7,26.9 L72.3,26.0 L75.9,25.1 L79.5,24.3 L83.1,23.6 L86.6,22.9 L90.2,22.3 L93.8,21.7 L97.4,21.3 L101.0,20.9 L104.6,20.7 L108.2,20.5 L111.8,20.4 L115.4,20.4 L119.0,20.6 L122.6,20.8 L126.2,21.1 L129.8,21.5 L133.4,22.0 L136.9,22.6 L140.5,23.2 L144.1,23.9 L147.7,24.7 L151.3,25.6 L154.9,26.4 L158.5,27.4 L162.1,28.3 L165.7,29.2 L169.3,30.2 L172.9,31.2 L176.5,32.1 L180.1,33.1 L183.7,34.0 L187.3,34.9 L190.